where it lives; nothing from those modules is copied into this tree. The
notable ones:

  github.com/charmbracelet/*   MIT   bubbletea, lipgloss, bubbles, glamour
  modernc.org/sqlite           BSD-3 pure-Go SQLite (D-009)
  github.com/zalando/go-keyring MIT  OS keychain access (D-002)
